{"audit_run_id":"audit:c9cd5fad11c748e3bf0d465c02aaca60","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":76,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"`zebrafish_activity.csv` holds the novel-tank swimming data from the 14-day"},{"end_column":79,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"low-dose fluoxetine exposure in adult zebrafish (*Danio rerio*). It is a plain"},{"end_column":58,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"comma-separated file with a header line and 96 data rows."},{"end_column":80,"end_line":11,"start_column":1,"start_line":11,"text":"One row is one fish. It carries that fish's identity, the tank it lived in, the"},{"end_column":81,"end_line":12,"start_column":1,"start_line":12,"text":"water condition that tank received, the fish's body size, and the total distance"},{"end_column":80,"end_line":13,"start_column":1,"start_line":13,"text":"it swam during its own 6-minute novel-tank video trial. Every fish was recorded"},{"end_column":58,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"individually, so a fish appears exactly once in the file."},{"end_column":58,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"- 8 tanks (3 L each), labelled `TNK-01` through `TNK-08`."},{"end_column":67,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"- 12 fish per tank, labelled `F01` through `F12` inside each tank."},{"end_column":54,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"- 96 rows in total, one per fish (8 tanks x 12 fish)."},{"end_column":80,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"- Fluoxetine was dosed into the tank water, so the water condition was set once"},{"end_column":51,"end_line":22,"start_column":3,"start_line":22,"text":"per tank and shared by all 12 fish in that tank."},{"end_column":75,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"- Rows are stored in collection order, tank by tank, starting at `TNK-01`."},{"end_column":80,"end_line":27,"start_column":1,"start_line":27,"text":"The `exposure` column splits the file into two conditions, assigned whole tanks"},{"end_column":11,"end_line":28,"start_column":1,"start_line":28,"text":"at a time:"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":30,"start_column":1,"start_line":30,"text":"- **control** - clean system water. Tanks `TNK-01`, `TNK-02`, `TNK-03`, `TNK-04`;"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":31,"start_column":3,"start_line":31,"text":"4 tanks, 48 fish."},{"end_column":77,"end_line":32,"start_column":1,"start_line":32,"text":"- **fluoxetine** - 5 micrograms per litre waterborne fluoxetine for 14 days."},{"end_column":66,"end_line":33,"start_column":3,"start_line":33,"text":"Tanks `TNK-05`, `TNK-06`, `TNK-07`, `TNK-08`; 4 tanks, 48 fish."},{"end_column":32,"end_line":37,"start_column":1,"start_line":37,"text":"| Column | Type | Description |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":38,"start_column":1,"start_line":38,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":151,"end_line":39,"start_column":1,"start_line":39,"text":"| `aquarium_ref` | text | The 3 L tank the fish lived in, written `TNK-01` through `TNK-08`. All 12 fish sharing a value here shared the same water. |"},{"end_column":115,"end_line":40,"start_column":1,"start_line":40,"text":"| `exposure` | text | The water condition that tank received: `control` or `fluoxetine`. Constant within a tank. |"},{"end_column":202,"end_line":41,"start_column":1,"start_line":41,"text":"| `fish_label` | text | Identifier for the individual fish, `F01` through `F12`. Unique within its tank, so a fish is identified by the pair (`aquarium_ref`, `fish_label`), not by `fish_label` alone. |"},{"end_column":165,"end_line":42,"start_column":1,"start_line":42,"text":"| `body_length_mm` | number | Standard length of the fish in millimetres, measured at the end of the exposure. Values run from 31.4 to 39.1 mm, one decimal place. |"},{"end_column":201,"end_line":43,"start_column":1,"start_line":43,"text":"| `distance_cm` | number | Total distance the fish moved during its 6-minute novel-tank trial, in centimetres. This is the outcome of interest. Values run from 838.7 to 1693.8 cm, one decimal place. |"},{"end_column":52,"end_line":47,"start_column":1,"start_line":47,"text":"None. All 96 rows have a value in all five columns."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:3f1affbe0dd40201e9b2","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.19.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:2c194af2b9c768ef007b9e435dfa300e29fdcc4042bd1ad2700a2bee49f13d7b","end_line":47,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-47","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:c9cd5fad11c748e3bf0d465c02aaca60","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":89,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Compare `distance_cm` between the two levels of `exposure` (`control` and `fluoxetine`)."},{"end_column":96,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"The independent experimental unit is the tank. The column `aquarium_ref` carries the value that"},{"end_column":161,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"identifies it: each tank has one distinct `aquarium_ref` value. The water condition was set once per tank, so the tank is the unit that was assigned to a group."},{"end_column":94,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"The analysis is a two-group comparison of `distance_cm` between the two levels of `exposure`."},{"end_column":89,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"This protocol does not select, require, or exclude any particular statistical procedure."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:d06454121acc903ec69c","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.19.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:e6fa7414eb8804f7a0254dede76b6a2ce9e30eaa22f24fb77ea3b6561b250058","end_line":15,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-15","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
